sis strengthens. I think the cleanest approach that satisfies \"align with the other three\" is:\n\n- 内在涨幅: +10.6% (42.34 元 vs 38.29) — aligns closely with 芒格's +10.7% ✓\n- 击球区: 🟡偏绿 / 已进入建仓区间 — consistent with 段永平's \"现价已低于建仓线\" and 芒格's \"🟡附近偏绿\" ✓\n- 目标建仓价: keep Buffett methodology. Options: 38.5 (unchanged from old report) — since price is now 38.29 < 38.5, \"现价即可启动第一批\". This is consistent with 段永平's view (现价已破线). But note 段永平's 建仓线 is 40.8 — quite different.\n\nHmm wait, let me re-read 段永平's numbers: \"建仓线 40.8 元（PB 0.85x）——现价 38.29 元已低于建仓线；补仓线 36 元（PB 0.75x / 股息率 5.6%）\". 40.8/47.3 = 0.863. PB 0.85x would imply BVPS 48. Maybe 段永平 used a different BVPS. Anyway.\n\nAnd 李录: 建仓 37.0 (PB 0.82x Q1), 补仓 33.5 (PB 0.74x).\n\nBuffett old: 建仓 38.5 (PB 0.81x 2026E), 补仓 35.0 (PB 0.74x 2026E).\n\nThese are three different risk tolerances. The task allows justified differences. The Buffett perspective's justification: 财务质量视角 sees \"质量 × 价格\" at historical extremes, with 股息 5.3% 托底, so its 建仓价 sits between 段永平 (highest, business model) and 李录 (lowest, risk).\n\nI'll keep Buffett 建仓价 at 38.5 元 (现价 38.29 已低于建仓价，第一批可启动) — matching 段永平's \"现价已破线，第一批可启动\" stance. And 补仓 35.0 元 (below 悲观情景 35.5 元, PB 0.74x) — between 段永平 36.0 and 李录 33.5, close to 段永平.\n\nActually wait. Let me reconsider. Should I move 建仓价 to 38.29 (现价) or keep 38.5? The old report said 建仓价 38.5 \"≈现价区域\". With 现价 now 38.29, keeping 38.5 means price is slightly below 建仓线 — \"现价即可启动第一批\" still holds. I'll keep 38.5 and note 现价 38.29 已低于建仓价.\n\nHmm, but actually there's a subtlety: should the Buffett 建仓价 align with the consensus of the other three? Let me look at what the 综合研判-20260819.md says — that might give the team-level consensus. Let me read it. Also the 财务估值-巴菲特视角-20260819.md exists! Let me read that too — it's the \"new\" Buffett file from round 2. Wait, the task says the old file (no suffix) is \"内容已过时\" and I should rewrite the old file. But there's already a -20260819 version. Let me check it — maybe it was created in round 2 and is the baseline I should align with? Let me read both the 综合研判 and the -20260819 Buffett file.\n\nActually the task explicitly says:\n2) 读旧文件 reports/600036招商银行-财务估值-巴菲特视角.md（财务估值 视角，内容已过时）\n3) 重写 reports/600036招商银行-财务估值-巴菲特视角.md\n\nSo the target file is the one WITHOUT suffix. But there's a -20260819 file for Buffett too. Hmm, interesting. The task was probably designed assuming the 财务估值 perspective didn't get a round-2 update (maybe the round-2 Buffett file was created but the team-lead didn't integrate it, or the task author overlooked it). Let me read the -20260819 Buffett file and the 综合研判 file to get the full picture.",
